    <basecompoundref prot="public" virt="non-virtual">Uninitialized&lt; _TempStorage &gt;</basecompoundref>
    <briefdescription>
<para>The operations exposed by <ref refid="classcub_1_1WarpScan" kindref="compound">WarpScan</ref> require a temporary memory allocation of this nested type for thread communication. This opaque storage can be allocated directly using the <computeroutput>__shared__</computeroutput> keyword. Alternatively, it can be aliased to externally allocated memory (shared or global) or <computeroutput>union</computeroutput>&apos;d with other storage allocation types to facilitate memory reuse. </para>
